{"id":399,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"たくましい知性と開かれた感性を育む教育","feature_description":"横浜雙葉はキリスト教の価値観を基盤に、自分を深め、人と関わり、世界をつなぐ教育を掲げています。教育の柱は「たくましい知性」「開かれた感性」「未来への責任」です。教科の学びや体験を通じて知性と感性を育て、他者と社会に向き合う姿勢を培います。中高合同で行うクラブ活動など、学年を越えて協働する機会も設けています。三つの目標を学校生活全体で実践する方針です。","clubs":[{"id":7490,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yokohamafutaba.ed.jp/highsch/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7491,"name":"ハイキング部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yokohamafutaba.ed.jp/highsch/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7492,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yokohamafutaba.ed.jp/highsch/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7493,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yokohamafutaba.ed.jp/highsch/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7494,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.yokohamafutaba.ed.jp/highsch/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7495,"name":"器楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yokohamafutaba.ed.jp/highsch/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7496,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yokohamafutaba.ed.jp/highsch/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7497,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yokohamafutaba.ed.jp/highsch/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7498,"name":"家庭部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yokohamafutaba.ed.jp/highsch/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7499,"name":"生物部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yokohamafutaba.ed.jp/highsch/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7500,"name":"新聞部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yokohamafutaba.ed.jp/highsch/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7501,"name":"音楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.yokohamafutaba.ed.jp/highsch/school